# Open questions — <project-name>

> The ratification parking lot — questions whose resolution requires the human. The ratification ladder lives in the driver (the only context that talks to the human); this file is where it parks the open asks. When answered, the resolution moves into `DECISIONS.md` (with a new D-entry) and any blocked units become ready in the ledger frontier.
>
> **Blocking vs non-blocking.** A *blocking* question names the unit(s) that cannot proceed without the answer — the driver holds those nodes out of the ready set until it resolves. A *non-blocking* question can be carried while work continues around it.

